Package: enrichVolcano
Title: Volcano-in-Ring and Concordance Plots from Enrichment Results
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dustyn", "Lewis", , "dtlts14@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws figures from gene-set enrichment results computed
    elsewhere. Results from fgsea, clusterProfiler, limma's rotation and
    competitive gene-set tests, over-representation analysis or custom
    tables are converted into one validated object. From it the package
    draws a differential abundance volcano inside a ring of enrichment
    terms, and a scatter comparing two contrasts term by term. Redundant
    terms can be flagged for display with the EnrichmentMap overlap rule or
    'fgsea' conditional collapsing, without changing any p-value.
